<topic id="git-client-unsorted-uicontrols">
    <title>git-shared-controls</title>
    <body>
    <p>Editor's note: uicontrol labels that exist in multiple locations across the UI. They are
      non-specific and thus generic.</p>
    <!--REPOSITORY CONTROL-->
      <!--use syntax gitcli over git to differentiate from Git proper for ids-->
    <p><uicontrol id="gitcli-push" >Push</uicontrol></p>
      <p><uicontrol id="gitcli-pull">Pull</uicontrol></p>
      <p><uicontrol id="gitcli-pull...">Pull...</uicontrol></p>
    <p><uicontrol id="git-pull-merge">Pull (merge)</uicontrol></p>
      <p><uicontrol id="git-pull-rebase">Pull (rebase)</uicontrol></p>
  </body>
</topic>
